      "source": "Extension for <a href=\"../../spring-web/org.springframework.web.client/-rest-operations/post-for-entity.html\">RestOperations.postForEntity</a> providing a <code class=\"lang-kotlin\">postForEntity&lt;Foo&gt;(...)</code> variant leveraging Kotlin reified type parameters. Like the original Java method, this extension is subject to type erasure. Use <a href=\"exchange.html\">exchange</a> if you need to retain actual generic type arguments.",
